{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729160/extras/d44777ab5d6a061fcf7ce8e6754bb55c.avif?t=1770230433\" width=599 height=105 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wasteland Shop Simulator</strong> is a quirky post-apocalyptic shop management game where you turn a rundown shack into a thriving retail empire. Stock shelves with scavenged goods, hire staff, fend off thieves, and keep eccentric customers happy while surviving in a dusty, dangerous world. Expand to new locations, customize your shop, and build your reputation in a wasteland where supply and demand take on a whole new meaning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729160/extras/58247c8d5a76864a202e9d24ad67aa2a.poster.avif?t=1770230433\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729160/extras/58247c8d5a76864a202e9d24ad67aa2a.webm?t=1770230433\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729160/extras/58247c8d5a76864a202e9d24ad67aa2a.mp4?t=1770230433\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729160/extras/c3280b055a6bd0dce8a85c10a2d8fdd2.avif?t=1770230433\" width=599 height=105 /></span>:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shop Setup</strong> \u2013 Buy shelves, tables, corner racks, and more to design the ultimate scavenger\u2019s storefront.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Decorate Your Store</strong> \u2013 Customize your space to reflect your unique post-apocalyptic aesthetic.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rent Multiple Shops</strong> \u2013 Expand your retail empire across the wasteland.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize Signage</strong> \u2013 Change your store name and sign color to stand out from the competition.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customer Chaos</strong> \u2013 Watch customers randomly mess up your displays \u2014 cleaning up is part of the job.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hire Staff</strong> \u2013 Bring on workers to help with stocking, sales, and managing the madness.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore the Wasteland</strong> \u2013 Venture out to scavenge unique, valuable, or just plain weird items.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Beware of Thieves</strong> \u2013 Not everyone is there to buy \u2014 keep an eye on your goods!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your fortune from the ashes and prove that even after the world ends\u2026 retail never dies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3729160?t=1770230433","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729160/a31d14bc6864d6ef81b372aaaa1fda162a50b0eb/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770230433","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729160/c61c2ed8befbe4efe56717bd7244b1821675ddaa/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770230433","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729160/c61c2ed8befbe4efe56717bd7244b1821675ddaa/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770230433","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4066400,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/stea