ze Signage</strong> \u2013 Change your store name and sign color to stand out from the competition.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customer Chaos</strong> \u2013 Watch customers randomly mess up your displays \u2014 cleaning up is part of the job.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hire Staff</strong> \u2013 Bring on workers to help with stocking, sales, and managing the madness.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore the Wasteland</strong> \u2013 Venture out to scavenge unique, valuable, or just plain weird items.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Beware of Thieves</strong> \u2013 Not everyone is there to buy \u2014 keep an eye on your goods!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your fortune from the ashes and prove that even after the world ends\u2026 retail never dies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Fargamer Studios Ltd"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729160/6bcfe2f1c4f186285051593396b33b3505d622b4/header.jpg?t=1770230433","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3729160/107839618/1a3457fa66bb3b9b13a32386db7f1b0337274120/1756131087/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758615575","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3729160/107839618/1a3457fa66bb3b9b13a32386db7f1b0337274120/1756131087/dash_h264.mpd?t=1758615575","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3729160/107839618/1a3457fa66bb3b9b13a3